# Trust anchors for the `official` tier, compiled into bastion-agent
# (src/extension/trust.rs). One key per line:
#
#   <publisher> ed25519 <standard base64 of the 32-byte Ed25519 public key>
#
# A pack whose pack.toml.sig verifies against one of these keys installs as
# `official`; anything else installs as `local`, and a signature that does not
# verify is refused. Several lines for the same publisher are allowed (key
# rotation). Only PUBLIC keys belong here; the private key never enters a
# repository. See bastion-extensions' README ("Signing") for how the key pair
# is generated and how packs are signed.
#
# No official key has been published yet: until a line is added below, every
# pack installs as `local`.
